+/*************************************************************************
+ * FUNCTION
+ *	capture
+ *
+ * DESCRIPTION
+ *	This function setup the CMOS sensor in capture MY_OUTPUT mode
+ *
+ * PARAMETERS
+ *
+ * RETURNS
